<title>USA: Radius Q3 shr loss $0.14 vs profit $0.26.</title>
<headline>Radius Q3 shr loss $0.14 vs profit $0.26.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Radius Inc.</p>
<p>	     (in thousands, except per share data; unaudited)</p>
<p>				Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>					 June 30,	   June 30,</p>
<p>				     1997     1996     1997     1996</p>
<p> Sales			    $4,816  19,234   23,867    82,461</p>
